> - **QC.** None. 14.2 keeps the shipped QC_AFAC 0.111; the field tag anchor 1.242 passes the PREREG38 height increment gates and the PREREG40 measured top height gate, but fails the PREREG38 published TOPHT gate and does not clear the seedling start Bakuzis QC grid (PREREG41), and the track is closed (PREREG42 close out note). A Bakuzis grid from measured stand lists does not clear 1.242 for 14.3 either (PREREG44). For 14.3, the relative height multiplier of PREREG45 passes every benchmark gate but is not cleared on long run grounds; its NB counterpart (PREREG45b) is not adopted. The zero form of PREREG46 names no candidate, and the PREREG47 reading finds no QC arm read credible on the long run.
